WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:48.844
Come on, Peter.


00:02:49.961 --> 00:02:50.803
Wake up.


00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:51.971
Peter.


00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:53.181
Wake up.


00:02:54.383 --> 00:02:55.384
Here's your suit.


00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:02.395
Do you know if your sister
slept in her room last night?


00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.060
I don't know.


00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:09.155
Come on, Peter. Get up.


00:03:32.546 --> 00:03:35.391
Oh, Charlie. For God's sake, come on.


00:03:38.135 --> 00:03:39.762
It was freezing last night.


00:03:40.387 --> 00:03:41.764
That's how you get pneumonia.


00:03:42.305 --> 00:03:43.147
That's okay.


00:03:44.015 --> 00:03:46.143
Okay, come on. Let's go. We're late.


00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.853
Your mother's in the car already.


00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.407
Um...


00:04:02.117 --> 00:04:06.964
It's heartening to see
so many strange, new faces here today.


00:04:07.789 --> 00:04:11.544
Um, I know my mom would be very touched


00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:14.471
and probably a little suspicious...


00:04:15.213 --> 00:04:18.388
um, to see this turnout. So...


00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:26.851
My mother was a very secretive
and private woman.


00:04:27.642 --> 00:04:29.645
She had private rituals,


00:04:29.728 --> 00:04:32.447
private friends, private anxieties.


00:04:33.315 --> 00:04:36.693
It honestly feels like a betrayal just
to be standing here talking about her.


00:04:43.742 --> 00:04:46.040
<i>She was a very difficult woman to read.</i>


00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:49.756
<i>If you ever thought you knew
what was going on with her,</i>


00:04:50.165 --> 00:04:52.338
<i>and, God forbid,
you tried to confront that...</i>


00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:59.926
<i>But when her life was unpolluted,
she could be the sweetest, warmest,</i>


00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:01.931
<i>most loving person in the world.</i>


00:05:04.179 --> 00:05:06.101
She was also incredibly stubborn,


00:05:06.181 --> 00:05:08.684
which, maybe, explains me.


00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:12.654
You could always count on her
to always have the answer.


00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.817
And if she ever was mistaken,


00:05:17.651 --> 00:05:19.654
and, well, that was your opinion...


00:05:19.736 --> 00:05:20.908
And you were...


00:05:23.573 --> 00:05:24.540
wrong.


00:05:47.973 --> 00:05:49.520
There aren't nuts in that, huh?


00:05:50.141 --> 00:05:51.393
- No.
- Good.


00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:55.066
Does that have nuts?
'Cause we don't have the EpiPen.


00:05:55.146 --> 00:05:56.147
I know.


00:06:23.842 --> 00:06:25.810
Hello, Rexy!


00:06:26.136 --> 00:06:27.479
Good dog.


00:06:27.804 --> 00:06:29.056
Shoes off, everybody.


00:06:29.764 --> 00:06:31.812
Charlie, shoes off.


00:06:40.275 --> 00:06:41.367
It does feel weird.


00:06:42.986 --> 00:06:43.987
Yeah.


00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:46.872
Should I be sadder?


00:06:47.908 --> 00:06:49.785
You should be whatever you are.


00:06:50.493 --> 00:06:51.369
It'll come.


